r-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 11</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr ba-Zameer Mu'annas: بَيْتُهَا ← فِي بَيْتِهَا (Page 25–26)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتُهَا</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Jarr + ـهَا</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">فِي بَيْتِهَا</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• بَيْتُهَا (Uska ghar) se فِي بَيْتِهَا (Us (mu'annas) ke ghar mein) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 25–26):** Jab `ـهَا` wale ism se pehle Harf-e-Jarr (`فِي`، `مِنْ`، `إِلَىٰ`، `عَلَىٰ`، `بِـ`، `لِـ`) aata hai toh `ـهَا` se pehle wale harf ke neeche Zair (`ـِ`) aa jati hai (`فِي بَيْتِهَا`، `مِنْ قَرْيَتِهَا`، `بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهَا`), jabke `ـهَا` apni halat par barqarar rehta hai."}},{"id":"sec_s4l11_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail Quranic fiqron ka tarjuma khud kijiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s4l11_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Jab 'ـهَا' zameer wale ism par koi harf-e-jarr (fii, ilaa, min waghera) dakhil hota hai toh ism ke aakhri harf par kasrah (zer) aati hai, jaise: فِي بَيْتِهَا (uske ghar mein), إِلَىٰ بَيْتِهَا (uske ghar ki taraf). Zameer 'ـهَا' apni haalat par rehti hai."}},{"id":"sec_s4l11_s3","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s4l11_s3_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"بَيْتُهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْتُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Uska ghar","translations":{"en":"Her house","ur":"اس کا گھر","hi":"उसका घर"}},{"id":"s4l11_s3_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"إِلَىٰ بَيْتِهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْتِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Uske ghar ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To her house","ur":"اس کے گھر کی طرف","hi":"उसके घर की तरफ़"}},{"id":"s4l11_s3_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"رَبُّهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبُّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Uska Rabb","translations":{"en":"Her Lord","ur":"اس کا رب","hi":"उसका रब"}},{"id":"s4l11_s3_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"مِنْ رَبِّهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Uske Rabb se","tran